+/*
+ * The iOS boot logo, lifted from the iPhone X root:
+ *   /usr/share/progressui/applelogo@3x.tga (450x450 RGBA)
+ * The alpha channel is cropped to its 194x238 bounding box and quantised to
+ * 2 bits (four alpha levels; the logo itself is pure white).  It is drawn at
+ * native size in the middle of the 1080x2400 panel, in the same place the
+ * 450x450 canvas sits on an iPhone X screen.
+ *
+ * Used by AppleCLCD::start() when the boot argument sweetlogo=1 is present:
+ * the screen is cleared to black, the logo is blitted, and the text console
+ * is muted from then on.  The persistent log (patch 0047) still receives
+ * every character, and a panic un-mutes the screen (patch 0067).
+ */
